      },
      "cr": 0,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — Kurimura Airi.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, generated from the article's own words. no XP ledger entry; archetype default → CR 0 as a student. Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>The One With The Chocolate / Classroom 2-B</strong> — Trinity General School, Classroom 2-B</p><p>Status: Active — student, Classroom 2-B; founding member of the outfit-design alliance formed during the advisor's first roll call</p><p>Airi sits by the window, keeps chocolate in her desk drawer, and is the social connective tissue of Classroom 2-B. She welcomed the new advisor, briefed the newcomer on what was normal, gave the advisor a chocolate mint, then carried another one to the back of the room for the student nobody else was talking to. Her enthusiasm is constant and occasionally deafening, and it is also the only thing in the room that reliably crosses the seating politics.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Fists</strong> — “The One With The Chocolate / Classroom 2-B”</li><li><strong>Hidden in Plain Sight</strong> — “Underneath it, in one session, she: reassured the newcomer that they were in the right room; told them Mika behaves this way with every new teacher so they would not take it personally; gave the advisor a chocolate”</li><li><strong>Mechanical Aptitude</strong> — “That is the session's warmest moment and it was engineered, accidentally, by someone who wanted to put balloons on tactical gear.”</li><li><strong>Loud</strong> — “Airi screamed with joy.”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/kurimura_airi</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/kurimura_airi</code>.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
